# Protagonist face graphics for dialogue, 48x48 bust, transparent background.
# Order: neutral, scared, sad, determined, surprised, relieved, angry, smile,
# eyes_closed (also the blink frame).
@palette ../palette/night-school.pal
@size 48 48
@output ../portraits/protagonist_faces.png
@preview ../previews/protagonist_faces_x4.png 4
# one file per expression for the character registry (docs/script-format.md 3)
@split ../../characters/protagonist/portraits
@columns 5

@frame neutral
